[38;2;124;124;124mKey concepts:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- Cosemisimple Hopf algebra: A Hopf algebra whose comodules are completely [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mreducible (dual notion to semisimple algebra). Equivalently, the dual algebra [0m
