[38;2;124;124;124mLet me think about what cocommutative cosemisimple Hopf algebras look like.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mBy the Cartier-Gabriel-Kostant-Milnor-Moore theorem (or the structure theorem [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mfor cocommutative Hopf algebras), a cocommutative Hopf algebra over an [0m
[38;2;124;124;124malgebraically closed field of characteristic 0 decomposes as:[0m

