[38;2;124;124;124mKostant-Milnor-Moore) says: Over an algebraically closed field of characteristic[0m[38;2;124;124;124m0, a cocommutative Hopf algebra $A$ is of the form $A \cong U(\mathfrak{g}) \# [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\mathbb{K}G$ where $\mathfrak{g} = P(A)$ is the Lie algebra of primitive [0m
